flowchart TD
    TG[Telegram message] -->|webhook POST + secret_token| W1["Cloudflare Worker 1<br/>validate, classify, split,<br/>upload media to R2, enqueue, fast ACK"]
    W1 -.->|👀 reaction| TG
    W1 --> Q["Cloudflare Queue<br/>(128KB/message limit)"]
    Q --> W2["Cloudflare Worker 2<br/>queue consumer: forwards jobs to Cloud Run<br/>+ fetch() handler: writes status to D1"]
    W2 -->|push, HTTP POST| CR["Google Cloud Run<br/>processing orchestrator<br/>(request-based billing, scales to zero)"]

    CR -->|blog URL jobs| BLOG["Playwright render →<br/>Trafilatura + extruct (metadata)"]
    BLOG --> SUM["Gemini summarize"]
    SUM --> REPLY[Telegram reply with summary]

    CR -->|native media, planned v3| MEDIA["pull bytes from R2"]
    CR -->|Instagram/YouTube URLs, planned v3| PI["Home Raspberry Pi (planned, v3)<br/>polls for fetch jobs, outbound HTTPS<br/>yt-dlp + cookies + PO-token provider"]
    PI -->|uploads audio| R2[(R2)]
    R2 --> MEDIA
    MEDIA --> GROQ["Groq API (planned, v3)<br/>Whisper large-v3-turbo — ASR only"]
    GROQ -->|transcript| SUM

    SUM -->|episode, planned v2| GRAPHITI["Graphiti (planned, v2)<br/>library inside Cloud Run:<br/>entity + relationship extraction"]
    CR -->|text notes, planned v2| GRAPHITI
    GRAPHITI --> GLLM["OpenAI (planned, v2)<br/>gpt-4.1-mini + text-embedding-3-small"]
    GRAPHITI -->|Direct VPC egress, private IP| KG[("FalkorDB (planned, v2)<br/>Docker on GCE e2-micro")]

    CR -.->|status updates| W2
    W2 -.->|status updates| D1[(D1)]
    W2 -.->|👌 once every job of the message is saved, planned v2| TG
